# SWE015 · Real-Time Chat Moderation: training on Google Colab

This notebook runs the whole pipeline: **data → 4 models → quantization → evaluation → app**.

1. **Runtime → Change runtime type → T4 GPU** (BERT fine-tuning needs the GPU; everything else runs on the CPU).
2. Run the cells from top to bottom. The whole notebook takes about 20-30 minutes.
3. **Every number for your slides comes from the outputs of this notebook.** Copy them from here or from `results/`.
